     - desktop: info column under the free-explainer, ABOVE "Your Shirts"
     Paste ONCE before end of body, just after the "Your shirts" strip block. Bump version on save. -->
<style>
#melolFeaturedStrip{margin:14px 0 4px;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;min-width:0;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;align-self:stretch;position:relative;z-index:1;}
#melolFeaturedStrip .fs-label{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#111;margin:0 0 8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
